    "body":  "Closes #820\n\n## Summary\n\nAdds the official Sentry service connection to the Switch connection catalog, closing #820.\n\n### Maintainer Mandate Alignment (Issue #820)\nIn accordance with maintainer guidance from @petr-sandbox on Issue #820 and `service-connections-v2.md`:\n- Configures `adapter: oauth` with `registration: dynamic` and `redirect: [loopback]` on ports 39231-39235.\n- Uses `tools: { mode: pass_through }` as required for OAuth entries by the loader.\n- Scopes strictly aligned with `https://mcp.sentry.dev/.well-known/oauth-authorization-server`:\n  - `read`: strictly `org:read` to permit issue search and trace inspection.\n  - `write`: `org:read`, `project:write`, `team:write`, `event:write`, `alerts:write`.\n  - Administrative deletion capability (`event:admin`) is explicitly omitted to enforce least privilege.\n- Documents the 8-hour (`28800`s) token lifetime provenance observed from the authorization server.\n- The connection skill (`SKILL.md`) enforces operational safety rules: read-before-write on issues, narrowing time windows, summarizing stack traces rather than dumping raw payloads containing PII, requiring explicit human confirmation before mutating or resolving issues, and indirect prompt injection defense.\n\n### Changes Included\n1. **Catalog Entry:** `core/switch_core/connections/catalog/sentry/connection.yaml`\n2. **Connection Skill:** `core/switch_core/connections/catalog/sentry/skill/SKILL.md` (clean, idiomatic, matching `datadog` / `atlassian`)\n3. **Desktop Assets \u0026 Color Tokens:**\n   - Vendored Simple Icons SVG logo: `console/apps/switch-console-desktop/src/assets/images/connections/sentry.svg`\n   - Attribution notice in `NOTICE.md`\n   - Brand color mapping in `connection-icon.tsx` (`sentry: \u0027text-[#362D59] emdark:text-foreground\u0027`)\n4. **Test Suite Enhancements:**\n   - `core/tests/switch_core/connections/test_loader.py`: Shipped catalog entry tests, skill validation, scope assertions.\n   - `core/tests/switch_core/connections/test_registry.py`: Dynamic client registration and scope configuration tests.\n   - `core/tests/switch_core/gateway/test_connection_catalog.py`: Catalog listing status assertion.\n   - `core/tests/switch_core/gateway/test_workspace_services.py`: Default workspace service assertion.\n",
